# Ticket Progress

Whenever a Jira task completes, invoke `update-ticket` to check its item in the main
ticket after required verification. Completion marks are already authorized. After a
significant implementation or review milestone, also assess whether a progress comment
is needed; draft comments and other description changes for approval before posting.

Before: a task finishes and the main Jira checklist remains unchecked.

After: the agent verifies the task and checks its item in the main Jira ticket, then
presents any additional progress comment for approval before posting.
